{
  "id": 1289,
  "name": "lonely-mint",
  "fling_power": 10,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "nature-mints",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/50/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　かおりを　かがせると\nこうげきが　あがりやすく　なるが\nぼうぎょは　あがりにくくなる　ミント。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "포켓몬에게 향기를 맡게 하면\n공격이 오르기 쉬워지지만\n방어가 오르기 어려워지는 민트.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "讓寶可夢聞這種薄荷的氣味，\n會令攻擊變得容易提高，\n但防禦則難以提高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si un Pokémon hume cet aromate, son Attaque\nmontera plus facilement, mais sa Défense\nse développera plus lentement.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lässt man ein Pokémon an dieser Minze schnuppern,\nsteigt sein Angriff schneller, aber seine Verteidigung\numso langsamer.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cuando un Pokémon percibe su aroma, aumenta con\nmás facilidad su Ataque, en detrimento de su Defensa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Quando un Pokémon ne sente il profumo, il suo Attacco\naumenta più facilmente a scapito della sua Difesa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "When a Pokémon smells this mint, its Attack will grow\nmore easily, but its Defense will grow more slowly.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　香りを　かがせると\n攻撃が　上がりやすく　なるが\n防御は　上がりにくくなる　ミント。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "宝可梦闻了这种薄荷之后，\n攻击会易于提高，\n而防御则难以提高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Cuando un Pokémon percibe su aroma, aumenta con\nmás facilidad su Ataque, en detrimento de su Defensa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
